<title>INDIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA'S OPENING TOUR GAME IS DRAWN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA'S OPENING TOUR GAME IS DRAWN.</headline>
<dateline>PATIALA, India 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The three-day opening tour game between the Indian Board President's XI and Australia ended in a draw on the final day on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 358-8 declared and 99-2, Board President's XI 262.</p>
</text>
